{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2014-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1388534400, "end_date": 1389139199, "month_true_total": 222, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 00:56:39 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "8612774", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018678281", "personaname": "Changed Daily", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/secretshow/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 691, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 691, "last_played": 1340175600, "avatar": "55f711f72d3edd1133e038278cd1f52602518860"}, "language": "english", "review": "While it is a free game and a goo one at that. I really wish that they would add some new content, even if i have to pay for it, I would love to see more levels for this game. It would also be good if the steam workshop were made availablefor this game so other people could add the content to the game. Like I said, A really great game, just lacking in content....I just saw that this thing comes with a level editor. People get on it.", "timestamp_created": 1389137140, "timestamp_updated": 1389137140, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8612134", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999103869", "personaname": "Jack Riffton", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/2061994/", "num_games_owned": 772, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 454, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 434, "last_played": 1389138058, "avatar": "ac54d22f628c694a2a5cf30bcef4f6ad31a838fb"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is a great FREE game. The main campaign takes awhile to get tired because of the difficulty involved if you don't work with your team but when it does get boring you can also download one of the many player made custom campaigns for free. The gameplay is overhead shooter and the different types of enemies and the fact that each class is essential to survival makes it very challenging and very replayable. I would definantly recommend this game.", "timestamp_created": 1389133856, "timestamp_updated": 1389133856, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8610582", "author": {"steamid": "76561198019914087", "personaname": "Witheld", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198019914087/", "num_games_owned": 172, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 2413, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2413, "last_played": 1389132973, "avatar": "b2a734431d40a6c110b7c09b1b3b65ad5819c79f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nice 3rd person shooter co op campaigns and its totally free.", "timestamp_created": 1389126473, "timestamp_updated": 1389126473, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8602848", "author": {"steamid": "76561197979984830", "personaname": "PorkChop", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PorkChop808/", "num_games_owned": 549, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 3130, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2927, "last_played": 1407336109, "avatar": "fe841e2453760abfc9a3ed95964658c7d691bd90"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best game on steam.", "timestamp_created": 1389084099, "timestamp_updated": 1389084099, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.481522947549819946", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8602170", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025352966", "personaname": "YourPetKat", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Blarst/", "num_games_owned": 317, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1116, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 958, "last_played": 1489646608, "avatar": "22440c345d7bc45b6ef39a5ce3c01178f031fc21"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is my favourite top down shooter of all time. It has a nice progression system so you get a sense of achievment upon leveling along with some intense battles against the alien horde. I think the only con is the lack of levels, there isn't much but you can download tonnes of community levels on websites with mods making the gameplay go on forever. Plus there is an easy to use dev kit so you can make levels and play them with your mates because its all FREE!!! 10/10 would reccomend this for the first steam game you get", "timestamp_created": 1389078409, "timestamp_updated": 1389078409, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}